msgid ""
"If you have observed an extreme weather situation in this geographical "
"context, you may contribute to the RiverCure Portal by submitting a <span "
"class='word-color'>Contribution</span>, in which you must include the type "
"of situation observed (flood, drought, etc), a description of what you saw, "
"the date and place of this episode, and, optionally, any videos or images "
"you have collected of the incident."
